---
# Test code follows the project configuration, with one exception:
#
#   clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange
#       Catch2's assertion macros combine the bit-flag values of its internal ResultDisposition
#       enum (CHECK_FALSE uses 2 | 4 = 6), which this opt-in check misreports as an invalid enum
#       value. Library code keeps the check.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange
